{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unmatched Speed and Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost across the battlefield, shred enemy squadrons in seconds, and fill the sky with explosions. Combat is fast, aggressive, and rewards relentless momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/94bf6b2cbe61755ac35796895e028100.poster.avif?t=1769029426\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/94bf6b2cbe61755ac35796895e028100.webm?t=1769029426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/94bf6b2cbe61755ac35796895e028100.mp4?t=1769029426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Unless\u00a0Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match components, stack powerful effects, and forge the perfect machine of destruction as your mech evolves in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/beae4d6be94269d972bcd214bd98f4ed.poster.avif?t=1769029426\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/beae4d6be94269d972bcd214bd98f4ed.webm?t=1769029426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611440/extras/beae4d6be94269d972bcd214bd98f4ed.mp4?t=1769029426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research and Unlock New Parts and Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each incursion expands your options, encouraging experimen